            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Festo akasema, Mfalme Agripa, na ninyi nyote mliopo hapa pamoja nasi, mnamwona mtu huyu, ambaye jamii yote ya Wayahudi huko Yerusalemu na hapa pia wamenitaka niwasaidie, wakipiga kelele kwamba haimpasi kuishi zaidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini mimi niliona kwamba hakutenda neno la kustahili kuuawa, na yeye mwenyewe alipotaka kuhukumiwa na Kaisari, nilikusudia kumpeleka kwake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami katika habari yake sina neno la hakika la kumwandikia bwana. Kwa hiyo nimemleta hapa mbele yenu, hasa mbele yako wewe, mfalme Agripa, ili akiisha kuhojiwa nipate neno la kuandika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa maana naona ni neno lisilo maana kumpeleka mfungwa, bila kuonesha mashitaka yale aliyoshitakiwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.27",
